@div ŋišgiŋal H

H.54. diŋir ni₂ guru₃ šag₄-ge# pad₃-da# dumu# {d}en#-[lil₂-la₂] niŋ₂ ha-ra-ab-gu-ul-[gu-ul]
#lem: diŋir[deity]; ni[fear]; gur[lift]; šag[heart]; pad[find]; dumu[child]; Enlil[1]DN; niŋ[thing]; gal[big]
#tr.en: May you, son of @wDN{Enlil}, chosen in his heart by the god imbued with awesomeness, be provided abundantly with everything! 
#etcsl: line-id=H.54

@div trailer 

H.55. ŋiš-gi₄-ŋal₂-bi-im#
#lem: ŋešgiŋal[musical refrain]
#tr.en: Its @fsux{ŋišgiŋal}. 
#etcsl: line-id=H.55

@end trailer

@end ŋišgiŋal

