#lem: An[1]DN; dug[speak]; nam[fate]; dug[good]; tar[cut]
#tr.en: What @wDN{An} says decides a good destiny; 
#etcsl: line-id=I.56

I.57. an gal-e dug₄-ga-ni nam dug₃ [tar-ra-am₃]
#lem: An[1]DN; gal[big]; dug[speak]; nam[fate]; dug[good]; tar[cut]
#tr.en: what the great @wDN{An} says decides a good destiny. 
#etcsl: line-id=I.57

I.58. {d}li-<pi₂-it-eš₄-tar₂> dumu {d}en-lil₂-la₂-ra šu [...]
#lem: Lipiteštar[1]RN; dumu[child]; Enlil[1]DN; šu[hand]; X
#tr.en: …… for @wRN{Lipit-@wDN{Eštar}}, son of @wDN{Enlil}. 
#etcsl: line-id=I.58

@div trailer 

I.59. u₁₉-ru₁₂-bi-im
#lem: uru[literary subscript]
